![Open-loop FOG response. Without bias (cos response) the gyro is blind to small rotations and to their sign. A ±π/2 phase modulation turns the response into sin(Δφ), which is linear and signed around zero (slides 295–297).](sensors_files/figure-html/fig-fog-output-2.png){#fig-fog width=742 height=425}
:::
